    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40919" root="هجأ" body-key="h">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجَأَ</span></b> , (S, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجَاَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجْءٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُجُوْءٌ</span>,
(K,) <i>It</i> (his hunger) <i>became appeased,</i> (S, K,)
<i>and departed,</i> or <i>ceased.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجَأَ</span> <i>He ate</i>
food. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجَأَ</span>, (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجْءٌ</span>, (TA,)
<i>He filled</i> his belly. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجَأَ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اهجأ</span></b>  <i>He
stayed,</i> or <i>restrained,</i> camels (K) or sheep or
goats, (TA,) <i>that they might pasture.</i> (K, TA.)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجِئَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجَاَ</span></b> , <i>He had raging hunger.</i> (K.)

